<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed that it downgraded Fluor Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said its confidence in management has slipped.</p>
<p>-- trimmed the price target to $60 a share from $70.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
